# The closure of a target is the receiver of bind, so it is not only called.
# CHECK: f0 Full
# CHECK-NEXT: f1 Full
# CHECK-NEXT: f2 Full
# CHECK-NEXT: f3 Full
# CHECK-NEXT: f4 Full
# CHECK-NEXT: f5 Full
# CHECK-NEXT: f6 Slim
# CHECK-NEXT: f7 Slim
# CHECK-NEXT: f8 Slim
# Each bound function stands behind the generic entrypoint of its target, in the order of the targets: onlyCalled, nameIsRead, lengthIsRead, testedWithInstanceOf, nameIsReadInApplication,
